{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_4","type":"agent_message","text":"I found `ArrayUtils` still declares a very large set of methods. I’m extracting the cohesive “search/index lookup” responsibility (`contains*`, `indexesOf*`, `indexOf*`, `lastIndexOf*`) into a dedicated superclass so `ArrayUtils` becomes thinner without changing its public API usage."}}
